{
  "version": 1,
  "goals": [
    {
      "id": "dd86a2ed-469b-49de-8291-26524170319e",
      "title": "LocalAppCatalog v1: per-country local-app dataset + curation tooling for VPN split-tunneling",
      "body": "Open-source global-first dataset of per-country local apps (banking, government, rideshare, messaging, streaming, shopping, wallet) consumed by split-tunnel VPN clients. Deliverables: data/schema.json + data/index.json + data/\u003ccc\u003e/\u003ccategory\u003e.json; tools/validate CI validator; tools/curate PR workflow; fetch/play_availability.py + fetch/store_adapters (Play, Cafe Bazaar, RuStore, AppGallery, APKPure, OneStore, Myket); checksummed GitHub Releases catalog-all.json + per-country bundles tagged vYYYY.MM.DD; CI + issue templates + nightly recheck; ODbL data / MIT tooling. DoD: consumer fetches catalog-\u003ccountry\u003e.json at a pinned version with zero false positives on global confusables (Google Wallet, PayPal, Telegram, WhatsApp, MiniChat, Amazon) for \u003e=3 countries beyond the seed set."
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
