      "id": "3bedf3c2-53d7-4565-8f38-2e4ccff361a0",
      "title": "Build bundler with checksums",
      "body": "tools/build/cli.mjs emitting dist/catalog-all.json, dist/catalog-\u003ccc\u003e.json and SHA-256 checksum manifests for GitHub Releases.",
      "goal_id": "dd86a2ed-469b-49de-8291-26524170319e"
    },
    {
      "id": "545335fc-1334-4a4b-bbbb-2336adbb567d",
      "title": "GitHub CI, nightly recheck, issue templates",
